"><hi rend="small-script left" snh:layout-kind="small-script" snh:layout-params="position=left" source="#source-59909-59948" corresp="#source-59912-59948"><seg source="#source-59909-59912">二</seg></hi><seg source="#source-59948-59954">ハチ</seg></hi></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-59983-62093"><seg source="#source-59983-60127">第一に數の文字の數が五と六であることが、これ等の數は十位の數であることを決定する。次に（二）の</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-60127-60192"><graphic url="fig3039_11.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字シ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-60192-60257"><graphic url="fig3039_30.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字フ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-60257-60350">は其位地により十の讀みに當るべきを以てシフと判讀せられる。即ち</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-60350-60415"><graphic url="fig3039_11.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字シ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-60415-60424">はシ、</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-60424-60489"><graphic url="fig3039_30.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字フ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-60489-60522">はフと同知する。同時に</seg><hi rend="keigakomi border(rule)" snh:layout-kind="keigakomi" snh:layout-params="border=rule" source="#source-60522-60612" corresp="#source-60522-60540 #source-60585-60612"><seg source="#source-60540-60546">　　</seg><hi rend="small-script left" snh:layout-kind="small-script" snh:layout-params="position=left" source="#source-60546-60585" corresp="#source-60549-60585"><seg source="#source-60546-60549">一</seg></hi></hi><seg source="#source-60612-60678">形内の讀方は否定されて消滅する。次に（三）の</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-60678-60743"><graphic url="fig3039_24.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字ニ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-60743-60758">と（四）の</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-60758-60823"><graphic url="fig3039_10.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字サ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-60823-60888"><graphic url="fig3039_48.png" width="20px" height="17px"/><figDesc>神代文字ン</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-60888-60972">とは連續する數を現はすものであるから、この條件に抵觸する</seg><hi rend="keigakomi border(rule)" snh:layout-kind="keigakomi" snh:layout-params="border=rule" source="#source-60972-61062" corresp="#source-60972-60990 #source-61035-61062"><hi rend="small-script left" snh:layout-kind="small-script" snh:layout-params="position=left" source="#source-60990-61029" corresp="#source-60993-61029"><seg source="#source-60990-60993">二</seg></hi><seg source="#source-61029-61035">　　</seg></hi><seg source="#source-61062-61101">形内の讀方は消滅する。次に</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-61101-61166"><graphic url="fig3039_10.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字サ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-61166-61301">は第三行及び第八行に言葉の首字となつてゐるから、ラ行の假名でない。即ち之をサと取る。同時に</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-61301-61366"><graphic url="fig3039_48.png" width="20px" height="17px"/><figDesc>神代文字ン</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-61366-61375">はン、</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-61375-61440"><graphic url="fig3039_24.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字ニ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-61440-61473">はニと決定する。而して</seg><hi rend="keigakomi border(rule)" snh:layout-kind="keigakomi" snh:layout-params="border=rule" source="#source-61473-61563" corresp="#source-61473-61491 #source-61536-61563"><hi rend="small-script right" snh:layout-kind="small-script" snh:layout-params="position=right" source="#source-61491-61530" corresp="#source-61494-61530"><seg source="#source-61491-61494">三</seg></hi><seg source="#source-61530-61536">　　</seg></hi><seg source="#source-61563-61602">形内の讀方は消滅する。次に</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-61602-61667"><graphic url="fig3039_45.png" width="20px" height="17px"/><figDesc>神代文字ロ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-61667-61754">は絶えて言葉の首字になつてゐないから、ラ行の字と取る。即ち</seg><hi rend="keigakomi border(rule)" snh:layout-kind="keigakomi" snh:layout-params="border=rule" source="#source-61754-61844" corresp="#source-61754-61772 #source-61817-61844"><seg source="#source-61772-61778">　　</seg><hi rend="small-script right" snh:layout-kind="small-script" snh:layout-params="position=right" source="#source-61778-61817" corresp="#source-61781-61817"><seg source="#source-61778-61781">四</seg></hi></hi><seg source="#source-61844-61874">形内の讀方が消滅して</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-61874-61939"><graphic url="fig3039_45.png" width="20px" height="17px"/><figDesc>神代文字ロ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-61939-61948">はロ、</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-61948-62013"><graphic url="fig3039_08.png" width="20px" height="19px"/><figDesc>神代文字ク</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-62013-62093">はクと同知される。以上合計七字が同知されたのである。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-62093-62881"><seg source="#source-62093-62198">二。第二十六行より始まり第三十行に終る五人の署名と覺しき終の三字は皆</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-62198-62263"><graphic url="fig3039_34.png" width="20px" height="19px"/><figDesc>神代文字ミ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-62263-62328"><graphic url="fig3039_09.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字コ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-62328-62393"><graphic url="fig3039_21.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字ト</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-62393-62513">となつてゐる。本文にも此組合が所々に出てゐるところを以て見れば、是は確に神代に屡</seg><g ref="#gaiji-1-2-22" source="#source-62513-62546">〻</g><seg source="#source-62546-62639">使用される語で、人名の終に着く尊のことであらう。この推定により</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-62639-62704"><graphic url="fig3039_34.png" width="20px" height="19px"/><figDesc>神代文字ミ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-62704-62713">はミ、</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-62713-62778"><graphic url="fig3039_09.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字コ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-62778-62787">はコ、</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-62787-62852"><graphic url="fig3039_21.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字ト</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-62852-62881">はトと同知される。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-62881-63852"><seg source="#source-62881-62971">三。象形文字と思はれるものが數多あるが、既にサと同知し得た</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-62971-63036"><graphic url="fig3039_10.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字サ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-63036-63075">は柵の象形なること明かで、</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-63075-63140"><graphic url="fig3039_24.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字ニ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-63140-63149">は荷、</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-63149-63214"><graphic url="fig3039_34.png" width="20px" height="19px"/><figDesc>神代文字ミ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-63214-63223">は身、</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-63223-63288"><graphic url="fig3039_21.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字ト</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-63288-63336">は戸の象形であらう。此例に傚へば</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-63336-63401"><graphic url="fig3039_15.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字タ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-63401-63419">は田即ちタ、</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-63419-63484"><graphic url="fig3039_19.png" width="20px" height="19px"/><figDesc>神代文字テ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-63484-63502">は手即ちテ、</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-63502-63567"><graphic url="fig3039_36.png" width="20px" height="14px"/><figDesc>神代文字メ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-63567-63585">は目即ちメ、</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-63585-63650"><graphic url="fig3039_38.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字ヤ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-63650-63668">は矢即ちヤ、</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-63668-63733"><graphic url="fig3039_46.png" width="20px" height="19px"/><figDesc>神代文字ワ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-63733-63852">は輪即ちワなること一見して明かである。其他にも澤山ある樣に見えるが速斷しない。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-63852-65341"><seg source="#source-63852-63951">四。以上三段の結果を第二十九行及び第三十行の尊の名前に應用すれば</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-63951-64016"><graphic url="fig3039_09.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字コ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-64016-64081"><graphic url="fig3039_38.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字ヤ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-64081-64146"><graphic url="fig3039_25.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字ネ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-64146-64211"><graphic url="fig3039_34.png" width="20px" height="19px"/><figDesc>神代文字ミ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-64211-64276"><graphic url="fig3039_09.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字コ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-64276-64341"><graphic url="fig3039_21.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字ト</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-64341-64350">はコヤ</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-64350-64415"><graphic url="fig3039_25.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字ネ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-64415-64427">ミコト、</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-64427-64492"><graphic url="fig3039_30.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字フ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-64492-64557"><graphic url="fig3039_21.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字ト</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-64557-64622"><graphic url="fig3039_15.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字タ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-64622-64687"><graphic url="fig3039_33.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字マ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-64687-64752"><graphic url="fig3039_34.png" width="20px" height="19px"/><figDesc>神代文字ミ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-64752-64817"><graphic url="fig3039_09.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字コ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-64817-64882"><graphic url="fig3039_21.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字ト</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-64882-64894">はフトタ</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-64894-64959"><graphic url="fig3039_33.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字マ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-64959-64980">ミコトとなり、</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-64980-65045"><graphic url="fig3039_25.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字ネ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-65045-65054">をネ、</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-65054-65119"><graphic url="fig3039_33.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字マ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-65119-65176">をマとすれば完全なる名前となる。由つて</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-65176-65241"><graphic url="fig3039_25.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字ネ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-65241-65250">はネ、</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-65250-65315"><graphic url="fig3039_33.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字マ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-65315-65341">はマと同知する。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-65341-65913"><seg source="#source-65341-65428">五。第四文書第二枚第三行平群眞鳥署名の左傍の神代文字花押</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-65428-65493"><graphic url="fig3039_33.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字マ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-65493-65558"><graphic url="fig3039_21.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字ト</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-65558-65623"><graphic url="fig3039_42.png" width="20px" height="23px"/><figDesc>神代文字リ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-65623-65632">はマト</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-65632-65697"><graphic url="fig3039_42.png" width="20px" height="23px"/><figDesc>神代文字リ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-65697-65712">であるから</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-65712-65777"><graphic url="fig3039_42.png" width="20px" height="23px"/><figDesc>神代文字リ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-65777-65822">はリと取つて間違なからう。即ち</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-65822-65887"><graphic url="fig3039_42.png" width="20px" height="23px"/><figDesc>神代文字リ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-65887-65913">をリと同知する。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-65913-68136"><seg source="#source-65913-65934">六。第二行に</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-65934-65999"><graphic url="fig3039_27.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字ハ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-65999-66064"><graphic url="fig3039_16.png" width="20px" height="21px"/><figDesc>神代文字チ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-66064-66129"><graphic url="fig3039_11.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字シ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-66129-66194"><graphic url="fig3039_30.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字フ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-66194-66259"><graphic url="fig3039_27.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字ハ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-66259-66324"><graphic url="fig3039_16.png" width="20px" height="21px"/><figDesc>神代文字チ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-66324-66389"><graphic url="fig3039_47.png" width="20px" height="24px"/><figDesc>神代文字ヲ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-66389-66454"><graphic url="fig3039_08.png" width="20px" height="19px"/><figDesc>神代文字ク</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-66454-66519"><graphic url="fig3039_33.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字マ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-66519-66584"><graphic url="fig3039_48.png" width="20px" height="17px"/><figDesc>神代文字ン</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-66584-66649"><graphic url="fig3039_25.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字ネ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-66649-66714"><graphic url="fig3039_48.png" width="20px" height="17px"/><figDesc>神代文字ン</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-66714-66729">とある中に</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-66729-66794"><graphic url="fig3039_11.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字シ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-66794-66859"><graphic url="fig3039_30.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字フ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-66859-66871">即ち十、</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-66871-66936"><graphic url="fig3039_33.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字マ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-66936-67001"><graphic url="fig3039_48.png" width="20px" height="17px"/><figDesc>神代文字ン</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-67001-67066"><graphic url="fig3039_25.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字ネ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-67066-67131"><graphic url="fig3039_48.png" width="20px" height="17px"/><figDesc>神代文字ン</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-67131-67251">即ち萬年など入つてゐるところを見ると此組合は數字と思はれる、而して象形と取られる</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-67251-67316"><graphic url="fig3039_27.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字ハ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-67316-67325">は葉、</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-67325-67390"><graphic url="fig3039_16.png" width="20px" height="21px"/><figDesc>神代文字チ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-67390-67435">は乳即ちハチを成立せしめる。又</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-67435-67500"><graphic url="fig3039_47.png" width="20px" height="24px"/><figDesc>神代文字ヲ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-67500-67565"><graphic url="fig3039_08.png" width="20px" height="19px"/><figDesc>神代文字ク</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-67565-67616">も數字とすれば億を想はしめ、同時に</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-67616-67681"><graphic url="fig3039_47.png" width="20px" height="24px"/><figDesc>神代文字ヲ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-67681-67891">は尾の象形なることが知られる。元來億はオクであるべきだが、神代に在つて自由に漢音を使ふ位であるからオヲの混同などは問題とならぬであらう。依て</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-67891-67956"><graphic url="fig3039_27.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字ハ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-67956-67965">はハ、</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-67965-68030"><graphic url="fig3039_16.png" width="20px" height="21px"/><figDesc>神代文字チ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-68030-68039">はチ、</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-68039-68104"><graphic url="fig3039_47.png" width="20px" height="24px"/><figDesc>神代文字ヲ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-68104-68136">はヲと同知せしめる。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-68136-69160"><seg source="#source-68136-68187">七。第一行終より第二行にかゝりて</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-68187-68252"><graphic url="fig3039_47.png" width="20px" height="24px"/><figDesc>神代文字ヲ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-68252-68317"><graphic url="fig3039_32.png" width="20px" height="19px"/><figDesc>神代文字ホ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-68317-68382"><graphic url="fig3039_34.png" width="20px" height="19px"/><figDesc>神代文字ミ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-68382-68447"><graphic url="fig3039_38.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字ヤ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-68447-68512"><graphic url="fig3039_47.png" width="20px" height="24px"/><figDesc>神代文字ヲ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-68512-68577"><graphic url="fig3039_17.png" width="20px" height="16px"/><figDesc>神代文字ツ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-68577-68642"><graphic url="fig3039_08.png" width="20px" height="19px"/><figDesc>神代文字ク</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-68642-68707"><graphic url="fig3039_42.png" width="20px" height="23px"/><figDesc>神代文字リ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-68707-68772"><graphic url="fig3039_19.png" width="20px" height="19px"/><figDesc>神代文字テ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-68772-68787">とあるがヲ</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-68787-68852"><graphic url="fig3039_32.png" width="20px" height="19px"/><figDesc>神代文字ホ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-68852-68861">ミヤヲ</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-68861-68926"><graphic url="fig3039_17.png" width="20px" height="16px"/><figDesc>神代文字ツ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-68926-68941">クリテで、</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-68941-69006"><graphic url="fig3039_17.png" width="20px" height="16px"/><figDesc>神代文字ツ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-69006-69069">は前後の關係からツと取るを自然とする。即ち</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-69069-69134"><graphic url="fig3039_17.png" width="20px" height="16px"/><figDesc>神代文字ツ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-69134-69160">をツと同知する。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-69160-70127"><seg source="#source-69160-69208">八。第八行第九行及び第十六行に</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-69208-69273"><graphic url="fig3039_12.png" width="20px" height="17px"/><figDesc>神代文字ス</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-69273-69338"><graphic url="fig3039_34.png" width="20px" height="19px"/><figDesc>神代文字ミ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-69338-69403"><graphic url="fig3039_41.png" width="20px" height="21px"/><figDesc>神代文字ラ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-69403-69468"><graphic url="fig3039_34.png" width="20px" height="19px"/><figDesc>神代文字ミ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-69468-69533"><graphic url="fig3039_09.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字コ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-69533-69598"><graphic url="fig3039_21.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字ト</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-69598-69631">と組合せてゐるが、是は</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-69631-69696"><graphic url="fig3039_12.png" width="20px" height="17px"/><figDesc>神代文字ス</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-69696-69699">ミ</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-69699-69764"><graphic url="fig3039_41.png" width="20px" height="21px"/><figDesc>神代文字ラ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-69764-69848">ミコトであるから、天津教のスミラミコトを想出させる。即ち</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-69848-69913"><graphic url="fig3039_12.png" width="20px" height="17px"/><figDesc>神代文字ス</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-69913-69922">をス、</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-69922-69987"><graphic url="fig3039_41.png" width="20px" height="21px"/><figDesc>神代文字ラ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-69987-70127">をラと同知するのである。幸に此想像によつた同知は他に應用して支障を生じないから確定して置く。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-70127-71548"><seg source="#source-70127-70172">九。第三行第七行第十一行等に</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-70172-70237"><graphic url="fig3039_02.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字イ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-70237-70302"><graphic url="fig3039_10.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字サ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-70302-70367"><graphic url="fig3039_23.png" width="20px" height="13px"/><figDesc>神代文字ナ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-70367-70432"><graphic url="fig3039_07.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字キ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-70432-70456">があり第十三行に</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-70456-70521"><graphic url="fig3039_02.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字イ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-70521-70586"><graphic url="fig3039_10.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字サ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-70586-70651"><graphic url="fig3039_23.png" width="20px" height="13px"/><figDesc>神代文字ナ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-70651-70716"><graphic url="fig3039_34.png" width="20px" height="19px"/><figDesc>神代文字ミ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-70716-70818">がある。而して第二十行に此二つの連續がある。此中に知られてゐる字は唯</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-70818-70883"><graphic url="fig3039_10.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字サ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-70883-70948"><graphic url="fig3039_34.png" width="20px" height="19px"/><figDesc>神代文字ミ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-70948-71071">の二字であるが、直覺的に是はイザナギ、イザナミであらうと云ふことに想達する。而して</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-71071-71136"><graphic url="fig3039_07.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字キ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-71136-71145">は木、</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-71145-71210"><graphic url="fig3039_23.png" width="20px" height="13px"/><figDesc>神代文字ナ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-71210-71309">は魚の象形と取ればよいので、此判讀の當つてゐることは疑ひない。即ち</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-71309-71374"><graphic url="fig3039_02.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字イ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-71374-71383">はイ、</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-71383-71448"><graphic url="fig3039_23.png" width="20px" height="13px"/><figDesc>神代文字ナ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-71448-71457">はナ、</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-71457-71522"><graphic url="fig3039_07.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字キ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-71522-71548">はキと同知する。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-71548-72676"><seg source="#source-71548-71569">十。第四行に</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-71569-71634"><graphic url="fig3039_02.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字イ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-71634-71699"><graphic url="fig3039_17.png" width="20px" height="16px"/><figDesc>神代文字ツ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-71699-71764"><graphic url="fig3039_02.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字イ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-71764-71829"><graphic url="fig3039_45.png" width="20px" height="17px"/><figDesc>神代文字ロ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-71829-71894"><graphic url="fig3039_29.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字ヒ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-71894-71959"><graphic url="fig3039_21.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字ト</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-71959-71974">、第五行に</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-71974-72039"><graphic url="fig3039_02.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字イ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-72039-72104"><graphic url="fig3039_45.png" width="20px" height="17px"/><figDesc>神代文字ロ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-72104-72169"><graphic url="fig3039_29.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字ヒ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-72169-72234"><graphic url="fig3039_21.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字ト</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-72234-72258">とあるはイツイロ</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-72258-72323"><graphic url="fig3039_29.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字ヒ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-72323-72335">ト、イロ</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-72335-72400"><graphic url="fig3039_29.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字ヒ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-72400-72463">トとなり、五色人を想出させる。さう思付けば</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-72463-72528"><graphic url="fig3039_29.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字ヒ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-72528-72579">は如何にも火の象形と取られる。依て</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-72579-72644"><graphic url="fig3039_29.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字ヒ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-72644-72676">をヒと同知せしめる。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-72676-73558"><seg source="#source-72676-72724">十一。第十行末より十一行に亙り</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-72724-72789"><graphic url="fig3039_01.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字ア</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-72789-72854"><graphic url="fig3039_33.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字マ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-72854-72919"><graphic url="fig3039_19.png" width="20px" height="19px"/><figDesc>神代文字テ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-72919-72984"><graphic url="fig3039_41.png" width="20px" height="21px"/><figDesc>神代文字ラ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-72984-73049"><graphic url="fig3039_12.png" width="20px" height="17px"/><figDesc>神代文字ス</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-73049-73114"><graphic url="fig3039_34.png" width="20px" height="19px"/><figDesc>神代文字ミ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-73114-73179"><graphic url="fig3039_09.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字コ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-73179-73244"><graphic url="fig3039_21.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字ト</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-73244-73256">とあるは</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-73256-73321"><graphic url="fig3039_01.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字ア</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-73321-73351">マテラスミコトにて、</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-73351-73416"><graphic url="fig3039_01.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字ア</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-73416-73467">をアとすれば天照らす尊となる。依て</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-73467-73532"><graphic url="fig3039_01.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字ア</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-73532-73558">をアと決定する。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-73558-73989"><seg source="#source-73558-73621">十二。第一行に二ヶ所、其他にも現るる組合</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-73621-73686"><graphic url="fig3039_47.png" width="20px" height="24px"/><figDesc>神代文字ヲ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-73686-73751"><graphic url="fig3039_32.png" width="20px" height="19px"/><figDesc>神代文字ホ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-73751-73898">はヲホとして大の意味に取れば意味通ずる。大は元來オホなれど天津教ではヲホで差支へないのである。故に</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-73898-73963"><graphic url="fig3039_32.png" width="20px" height="19px"/><figDesc>神代文字ホ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-73963-73989">をホと同知する。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-73989-74615"><seg source="#source-73989-74016">十三。第二十四行</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-74016-74081"><graphic url="fig3039_11.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字シ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-74081-74146"><graphic url="fig3039_15.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字タ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-74146-74211"><graphic url="fig3039_37.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字モ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-74211-74276"><graphic url="fig3039_30.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字フ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-74276-74330">はシタマフと爲すべき所なれどマは既に</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-74330-74395"><graphic url="fig3039_33.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字マ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-74395-74518">と同知せられてゐる故、天津教流に假名遣ひに頓着せずして、シタモフにて通ずるとなし、</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-74518-74583"><graphic url="fig3039_37.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字モ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-74583-74615">をモと同知して置く。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-74615-75211"><seg source="#source-74615-74642">十四。第二十七行</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-74642-74707"><graphic url="fig3039_12.png" width="20px" height="17px"/><figDesc>神代文字ス</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-74707-74772"><graphic url="fig3039_10.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字サ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-74772-74837"><graphic url="fig3039_26.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字ノ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-74837-74902"><graphic url="fig3039_47.png" width="20px" height="24px"/><figDesc>神代文字ヲ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-74902-74905">の</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-74905-74970"><graphic url="fig3039_26.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字ノ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-74970-75120">は野の象形でノ字なること明かである。是は隨所に現れてゐるが此推測の妥當なることが直に證明される。即ち</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-75120-75185"><graphic url="fig3039_26.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字ノ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-75185-75211">はノと同知する。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-75211-77819"><seg source="#source-75211-75235">十五。第十五行</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-75235-75300"><graphic url="fig3039_06.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字カ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-75300-75365"><graphic url="fig3039_06.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字カ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-75365-75430"><graphic url="fig3039_26.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字ノ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-75430-75495"><graphic url="fig3039_11.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字シ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-75495-75560"><graphic url="fig3039_41.png" width="20px" height="21px"/><figDesc>神代文字ラ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-75560-75625"><graphic url="fig3039_38.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字ヤ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-75625-75690"><graphic url="fig3039_33.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字マ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-75690-75755"><graphic url="fig3039_21.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字ト</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-75755-75820"><graphic url="fig3039_39.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字ユ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-75820-75885"><graphic url="fig3039_30.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字フ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-75885-75966">は前後の關係より加賀の白山と云ふと解すべきである。即ち</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-75966-76031"><graphic url="fig3039_06.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字カ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-76031-76040">はカ、</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-76040-76105"><graphic url="fig3039_39.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字ユ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-76105-76147">はイに當つべきも、イには既に</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-76147-76212"><graphic url="fig3039_02.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字イ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-76212-76248">が同知せられてあるから、</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-76248-76313"><graphic url="fig3039_39.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字ユ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-76313-76433">はユであらうと思はれる。蓋し此字は湯の象形である。此推斷の妥當なることは第七行の</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-76433-76498"><graphic url="fig3039_01.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字ア</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-76498-76563"><graphic url="fig3039_33.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字マ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-76563-76628"><graphic url="fig3039_08.png" width="20px" height="19px"/><figDesc>神代文字ク</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-76628-76693"><graphic url="fig3039_15.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字タ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-76693-76758"><graphic url="fig3039_42.png" width="20px" height="23px"/><figDesc>神代文字リ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-76758-76823"><graphic url="fig3039_21.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字ト</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-76823-76888"><graphic url="fig3039_39.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字ユ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-76888-76953"><graphic url="fig3039_30.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字フ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-76953-76968">、第九行の</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-76968-77033"><graphic url="fig3039_39.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字ユ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-77033-77098"><graphic url="fig3039_17.png" width="20px" height="16px"/><figDesc>神代文字ツ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-77098-77163"><graphic url="fig3039_42.png" width="20px" height="23px"/><figDesc>神代文字リ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-77163-77228"><graphic url="fig3039_09.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字コ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-77228-77293"><graphic url="fig3039_21.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字ト</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-77293-77311">、第十一行の</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-77311-77376"><graphic url="fig3039_39.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字ユ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-77376-77441"><graphic url="fig3039_17.png" width="20px" height="16px"/><figDesc>神代文字ツ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-77441-77506"><graphic url="fig3039_42.png" width="20px" height="23px"/><figDesc>神代文字リ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-77506-77571"><graphic url="fig3039_46.png" width="20px" height="19px"/><figDesc>神代文字ワ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-77571-77636"><graphic url="fig3039_15.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字タ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-77636-77701"><graphic url="fig3039_11.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字シ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-77701-77713">に於ける</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-77713-77778"><graphic url="fig3039_39.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字ユ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-77778-77819">の用例に照して明かである。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-77819-78090"><seg source="#source-77819-77873">十六。第五行及び第二十一行に現れる</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-77873-77938"><graphic url="fig3039_13.png" width="20px" height="19px"/><figDesc>神代文字セ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-77938-78090">は明かに象形字であるが、これは龜の如き動物の背を形どりたるものと解しセとする。それにて意味が通ずる。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-78090-78375"><seg source="#source-78090-78156">十七。第五行第六行第七行第十三行等に現れる</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-78156-78221"><graphic url="fig3039_40.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字ヨ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-78221-78284">は前後に鑑みてヨとすれば意味が通ずる。即ち</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-78284-78349"><graphic url="fig3039_40.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字ヨ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-78349-78375">をヨと同知する。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-78375-82588"><seg source="#source-78375-78396">十八。第八行</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-78396-78461"><graphic url="fig3039_35.png" width="20px" height="19px"/><figDesc>神代文字ム</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-78461-78526"><graphic url="fig3039_35.png" width="20px" height="19px"/><figDesc>神代文字ム</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-78526-78591"><graphic url="fig3039_47.png" width="20px" height="24px"/><figDesc>神代文字ヲ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-78591-78656"><graphic url="fig3039_08.png" width="20px" height="19px"/><figDesc>神代文字ク</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-78656-78721"><graphic url="fig3039_33.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字マ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-78721-78786"><graphic url="fig3039_48.png" width="20px" height="17px"/><figDesc>神代文字ン</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-78786-78851"><graphic url="fig3039_25.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字ネ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-78851-78916"><graphic url="fig3039_48.png" width="20px" height="17px"/><figDesc>神代文字ン</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-78916-78958">、第十一行より第十二行に至る</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-78958-79023"><graphic url="fig3039_02.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字イ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-79023-79088"><graphic url="fig3039_17.png" width="20px" height="16px"/><figDesc>神代文字ツ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-79088-79153"><graphic url="fig3039_35.png" width="20px" height="19px"/><figDesc>神代文字ム</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-79153-79218"><graphic url="fig3039_35.png" width="20px" height="19px"/><figDesc>神代文字ム</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-79218-79283"><graphic url="fig3039_33.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字マ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-79283-79348"><graphic url="fig3039_48.png" width="20px" height="17px"/><figDesc>神代文字ン</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-79348-79413"><graphic url="fig3039_25.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字ネ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-79413-79478"><graphic url="fig3039_48.png" width="20px" height="17px"/><figDesc>神代文字ン</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-79478-79493">、第十四行</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-79493-79558"><graphic url="fig3039_23.png" width="20px" height="13px"/><figDesc>神代文字ナ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-79558-79623"><graphic url="fig3039_23.png" width="20px" height="13px"/><figDesc>神代文字ナ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-79623-79688"><graphic url="fig3039_35.png" width="20px" height="19px"/><figDesc>神代文字ム</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-79688-79753"><graphic url="fig3039_35.png" width="20px" height="19px"/><figDesc>神代文字ム</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-79753-79818"><graphic url="fig3039_33.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字マ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-79818-79883"><graphic url="fig3039_48.png" width="20px" height="17px"/><figDesc>神代文字ン</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-79883-79948"><graphic url="fig3039_25.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字ネ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-79948-80013"><graphic url="fig3039_48.png" width="20px" height="17px"/><figDesc>神代文字ン</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-80013-80031">、第二十五行</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-80031-80096"><graphic url="fig3039_27.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字ハ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-80096-80161"><graphic url="fig3039_16.png" width="20px" height="21px"/><figDesc>神代文字チ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-80161-80226"><graphic url="fig3039_35.png" width="20px" height="19px"/><figDesc>神代文字ム</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-80226-80291"><graphic url="fig3039_35.png" width="20px" height="19px"/><figDesc>神代文字ム</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-80291-80356"><graphic url="fig3039_33.png" width="20px" height="18px"/><figDesc>神代文字マ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-80356-80421"><graphic url="fig3039_48.png" width="20px" height="17px"/><figDesc>神代文字ン</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-80421-80486"><graphic url="fig3039_25.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字ネ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-80486-80551"><graphic url="fig3039_48.png" width="20px" height="17px"/><figDesc>神代文字ン</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-80551-80560">（本文</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-80560-80625"><graphic url="fig3039_48.png" width="20px" height="17px"/><figDesc>神代文字ン</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-80625-80652">を脱す）等に於ける</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-80652-80717"><graphic url="fig3039_35.png" width="20px" height="19px"/><figDesc>神代文字ム</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-80717-80782"><graphic url="fig3039_35.png" width="20px" height="19px"/><figDesc>神代文字ム</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-80782-80848">は數字を現はすものと推測せられる。ところで一</seg><seg type="warichu" rend="two-line" source="#source-80848-80923"><seg source="#source-80866-80872">イチ</seg><lb source="#source-80872-80887"/><seg source="#source-80887-80896">ヒトツ</seg></seg><seg source="#source-80923-80926">二</seg><seg type="warichu" rend="two-line" source="#source-80926-80998"><seg source="#source-80944-80947">ニ</seg><lb source="#source-80947-80962"/><seg source="#source-80962-80971">フタツ</seg></seg><seg source="#source-80998-81001">三</seg><seg type="warichu" rend="two-line" source="#source-81001-81073"><seg source="#source-81019-81025">サン</seg><lb source="#source-81025-81040"/><seg source="#source-81040-81046">ミツ</seg></seg><seg source="#source-81073-81076">四</seg><seg type="warichu" rend="two-line" source="#source-81076-81145"><seg source="#source-81094-81097">シ</seg><lb source="#source-81097-81112"/><seg source="#source-81112-81118">ヨツ</seg></seg><seg source="#source-81145-81148">五</seg><seg type="warichu" rend="two-line" source="#source-81148-81220"><seg source="#source-81166-81169">コ</seg><lb source="#source-81169-81184"/><seg source="#source-81184-81193">イツヽ</seg></seg><seg source="#source-81220-81223">六</seg><seg type="warichu" rend="two-line" source="#source-81223-81295"><seg source="#source-81241-81247">ロク</seg><lb source="#source-81247-81262"/><seg source="#source-81262-81268">ムツ</seg></seg><seg source="#source-81295-81298">七</seg><seg type="warichu" rend="two-line" source="#source-81298-81373"><seg source="#source-81316-81322">シチ</seg><lb source="#source-81322-81337"/><seg source="#source-81337-81346">ナナツ</seg></seg><seg source="#source-81373-81376">八</seg><seg type="warichu" rend="two-line" source="#source-81376-81448"><seg source="#source-81394-81400">ハチ</seg><lb source="#source-81400-81415"/><seg source="#source-81415-81421">ヤツ</seg></seg><seg source="#source-81448-81451">九</seg><seg type="warichu" rend="two-line" source="#source-81451-81526"><seg source="#source-81469-81472">ク</seg><lb source="#source-81472-81487"/><seg source="#source-81487-81499">ココノツ</seg></seg><seg source="#source-81526-81529">十</seg><seg type="warichu" rend="two-line" source="#source-81529-81601"><seg source="#source-81547-81553">シフ</seg><lb source="#source-81553-81568"/><seg source="#source-81568-81574">トウ</seg></seg><seg source="#source-81601-81604">百</seg><seg type="warichu" rend="two-line" source="#source-81604-81679"><seg source="#source-81622-81631">ヒヤク</seg><lb source="#source-81631-81646"/><seg source="#source-81646-81652">モモ</seg></seg><seg source="#source-81679-81682">千</seg><seg type="warichu" rend="two-line" source="#source-81682-81754"><seg source="#source-81700-81706">セン</seg><lb source="#source-81706-81721"/><seg source="#source-81721-81727">チチ</seg></seg><seg source="#source-81754-81757">萬</seg><seg type="warichu" rend="two-line" source="#source-81757-81832"><seg source="#source-81775-81781">マン</seg><lb source="#source-81781-81796"/><seg source="#source-81796-81805">ヨロツ</seg></seg><seg source="#source-81832-81835">億</seg><seg type="warichu" rend="two-line" source="#source-81835-81886"><seg source="#source-81853-81859">オク</seg></seg><seg source="#source-81886-81997">と並べ見ると唯六の名稱に含まれてゐるムの字だけが殘されてゐるのである。即ち</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-81997-82062"><graphic url="fig3039_35.png" width="20px" height="19px"/><figDesc>神代文字ム</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-82062-82485">をムと取る。併しムを六として應用して見ると六六億萬年、一六六萬年、七六六萬年、八六六萬年等となり少しも意味を爲さない。然るに天津教ではモをムと訛る例は第四文書の根をムトと讀ませることで判つてゐるが、此所のムもモの訛と取ればムムもモモ即ち百と解せられる。而して意味は完全に通ずる。即ち</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-82485-82550"><graphic url="fig3039_35.png" width="20px" height="19px"/><figDesc>神代文字ム</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-82550-82588">をムとすることは正しい。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-82588-83051"><seg source="#source-82588-82639">十九。第二行第十六行第二十五行に</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-82639-82704"><graphic url="fig3039_14.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字ソ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-82704-82769"><graphic url="fig3039_08.png" width="20px" height="19px"/><figDesc>神代文字ク</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-82769-82834"><graphic url="fig3039_02.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字イ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-82834-82960">の言葉があるが第二十五行に於ける下の言葉との關係から即位に當るものと推定出來る。即ち</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-82960-83025"><graphic url="fig3039_14.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字ソ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-83025-83051">はソと同知する。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-83051-84463"><seg source="#source-83051-83141">二十。以上四十四字の中三十九字を同知し得たから、殘るものは</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-83141-83206"><graphic url="fig3039_03.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字ウ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-83206-83271"><graphic url="fig3039_04.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字エ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-83271-83336"><graphic url="fig3039_05.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字オ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-83336-83401"><graphic url="fig3039_31.png" width="20px" height="22px"/><figDesc>神代文字ヘ</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-83401-83466"><graphic url="fig3039_43.png" width="20px" height="19px"/><figDesc>神代文字ル</figDesc></figure><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-83466-83531"><graphic url="fig3039_44.png" width="20px" height="17px"/><figDesc>神代文字レ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-83531-83693">の六字となつた。而してイロハの側から見て同知されないものはヘヌルレウヰオケエヱの十字である。此等の十字を代る</seg><choice source="#source-83693-83699"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><seg source="#source-83699-83843">神代文字に當嵌め意味が通ずるや否やを見れば自ら同知が出來ることになるのである。同知の結果を云へば</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-83843-83908"><graphic url="fig3039_03.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字ウ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-83908-83917">はウ、</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-83917-83982"><graphic url="fig3039_04.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字エ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-83982-83991">はエ、</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-83991-84056"><graphic url="fig3039_05.png" width="20px" height="20px"/><figDesc>神代文字オ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-84056-84065">はオ、</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-84065-84130"><graphic url="fig3039_31.png" width="20px" height="22px"/><figDesc>神代文字ヘ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-84130-84139">はヘ、</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-84139-84204"><graphic url="fig3039_43.png" width="20px" height="19px"/><figDesc>神代文字ル</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-84204-84213">はル、</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-84213-84278"><graphic url="fig3039_44.png" width="20px" height="17px"/><figDesc>神代文字レ</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-84278-84463">はレである。これで文書中の文字は悉皆解つたのであるが、同時に又ケヌヰヱの四文字が文書内に現れてゐないことも判つたのである。</seg></p>
